{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Business Empire \u2013 Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Business Empire</strong> is a multiplayer board game where players strategically acquire properties and investments to build a commercial empire. This demo version allows you to experience the core mechanics of the game and supports up to <strong>2 players</strong> playing simultaneously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Version Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Property Selection</strong> \u2013 Instead of rolling dice, players can freely choose properties that fit their strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Development Mechanism</strong> \u2013 Purchased properties can be upgraded to increase their value and generate higher income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Chance Cards</strong> \u2013 Players will draw chance cards that provide unexpected advantages or disadvantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two-Player Multiplayer Mode</strong> \u2013 The demo version allows a maximum of <strong>2 players</strong> to compete online.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Important Notes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The full version supports up to 6 players, but the demo version is limited to 2 players.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some advanced features, property types, and investment options are only available in the full version.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Additional game modes and expanded language support are exclusive to the full version.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597460?t=1742479245","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597460?t=1742479245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor